  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with Nan's special seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64ec3d53b9acdcbab3495b0f-64ff6252.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, heat the plant-based butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic paste until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add basmati rice, the water and vegetable stock powder, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64ec3d53b9acdcbab3495b0f-745dedaa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, in a medium bowl, combine deluxe slaw mix and mustard cider dressing. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64ec3d53b9acdcbab3495b0f-c4e41060.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with smokey roast pumpkin and mustard slaw.\n• Top pumpkin with plant-based smokey aioli and chimichurri sauce.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64ec3d53b9acdcbab3495b0f-f5b19072.jpeg"
    }
  ]
